(6516648, 969350, 10785, '<td valign="top">This looks fairly underexposed. There is a lot of lost detail in the silhouetted areas. With Minimal editing it is a choice... expose for the sky or blow out the sky and expose for the foreground.</td>', 'This looks fairly underexposed. There is a lot of lost detail in the silhouetted areas. With Minimal editing it is a choice... expose for the sky or blow out the sky and expose for the foreground.', '2011-08-26 09:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6516649, 968316, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I think you could have gotten a hair better result with a symmetrical, even crop, meaning having four blocks cropped square or two blocks cropped in a rectangle etc. But as it stands, it is very humorous!<br/> <br/><i>(I just posted this a few seconds ago and realized it was minimal editing! So nice job indeed. I didn''t apply my critique about the crop to my vote and voted on the picture as is.)</i></td>', 'Very creative. I think you could have gotten a hair better result with a symmetrical, even crop, meaning having four blocks cropped square or two blocks cropped in a rectangle etc. But as it stands, it is very humorous! (I just posted this a few seconds ago and realized it was minimal editing! So nice job indeed. I didn''t apply my critique about the crop to my vote and voted on the picture as is.)', '2011-08-26 09:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
