(6523388, 969361, 100831, '<td valign="top">It sparkles!! I love the symmetry - I also enjoy thinking about how long it takes a spider to weave a web like this. 9</td>', 'It sparkles!! I love the symmetry - I also enjoy thinking about how long it takes a spider to weave a web like this. 9', '2011-09-01 13:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6523390, 969341, 100831, '<td valign="top">You shouldn''t be taking pictures while driving (that''s what my passengers say to me anyway)!!! Love it. Validated? Crimey.</td>', 'You shouldn''t be taking pictures while driving (that''s what my passengers say to me anyway)!!! Love it. Validated? Crimey.', '2011-09-01 14:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
