(6523892, 969362, 117912, '<td valign="top">Nice capture for through a window in the evening - I love the unexpectedness of looking out a window to find that nature is visiting. I''m sure many will complain about the window frame in the picture, but knowing how little time that there likely was to get the shot, its very well done.</td>', 'Nice capture for through a window in the evening - I love the unexpectedness of looking out a window to find that nature is visiting. I''m sure many will complain about the window frame in the picture, but knowing how little time that there likely was to get the shot, its very well done.', '2011-09-01 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
